Mr. Peanut is the logo for the Planter's Peanut Company.
花生先生是绅士牌花生公司的标志。

342
00:14:19.060 --> 00:14:19.360
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

343
00:14:19.640 --> 00:14:21.460
Which, listen to this.
而且，听听这个。

344
00:14:21.700 --> 00:14:21.900
What?
