So here's where he came from.
所以他的由来是这样的。

363
00:14:57.060 --> 00:15:01.860
They did a contest to have someone design a logo for the company.
公司当时举办了一场比赛，征集公司标志的设计。

364
00:15:01.860 --> 00:15:10.320
And a young schoolboy by the name of Antonio Gentile submitted a drawing of an anthropomorphic peanut.
有个叫安东尼奥·詹蒂莱的小学生提交了一幅拟人化花生的画。

365
00:15:10.500 --> 00:15:13.680
And he won the contest and he got $5.
他赢得了比赛，得到了5美元。

366
00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:15.320
$5.
5美元。

367
00:15:15.660 --> 00:15:15.980
$5.
5美元。

368
00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:23.640
But I'll have you know that the founder of the company, his name was Amidio Obici, if I'm saying that correctly.
但我得告诉你，公司创始人名叫阿米迪奥·奥比奇，如果我没读错的话。

369
00:15:23.640 --> 00:15:30.200
He was so taken with this little boy that he ended up paying his way through college and all of his siblings' way through college.
他非常欣赏这个小男孩，最后资助了他和所有兄弟姐妹的大学学费。

370
00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:31.480
Oh, I like hearing that.
噢，我喜欢听这个。

371
00:15:31.620 --> 00:15:35.720
So I guess he got $5 and a college education for himself and his siblings.
所以我猜他不仅得到了5美元，还让他自己和兄弟姐妹都读上了大学。

372
00:15:35.980 --> 00:15:42.380
There was a commercial artist named Andrew Wallach who added the monocle, the top hat, and the cane.
后来有一位叫安德鲁·沃拉克的商业艺术家加上了单片眼镜、大礼帽和手杖。

