00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:55.860
There is a disputed claim that a different artist actually added the monocle, top hat, and cane.
有争议称，其实是另一位艺术家加上了单片眼镜、大礼帽和手杖。

378
00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:58.800
The family of Frank P.
弗兰克·P·

379
00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:01.580
Creasy claims that he did it.
克里西的家人声称是他做的。

380
00:16:01.720 --> 00:16:05.960
He was a Wilkes-Barre artist and also the head of the Suffolk planter plant.
他是一位威尔克斯-巴里的艺术家，也是萨福克种植园工厂的负责人。

381
00:16:06.180 --> 00:16:07.440
They think he did it.
他们认为是他做的。

382
00:16:07.560 --> 00:16:09.720
So, Mom Detective, what happened?
那么，“妈妈侦探”，结果如何？

383
00:16:10.380 --> 00:16:11.640
Thank you, Angela.
谢谢你，安吉拉。

384
00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:19.080
There are no sources still in circulation that can positively identify the artiSt.
目前没有任何现存资料能确切证实那位艺术家的身份。

385
00:16:19.600 --> 00:16:21.600
We know the little boy started it all.
我们知道是那个小男孩开启了一切。

386
00:16:21.780 --> 00:16:24.480
But who added the monocle, top hat, and cane?
但究竟是谁加上了单片眼镜、大礼帽和手杖呢？

387
00:16:24.700 --> 00:16:25.640
We'll never know.
我们永远不会知道了。

388
00:16:25.860 --> 00:16:27.520
We'll never really know.
我们永远都不会真正知道了。

389
00:16:27.700 --> 00:16:28.380
There you go.
就是这样。

