00:16:36.460 --> 00:16:38.500
I think many of them will in that way.
我觉得很多集都会是这样。

393
00:16:39.780 --> 00:16:42.120
Well, I have a little thing to share about the script.
嗯，关于剧本我有个小发现想分享。

394
00:16:42.320 --> 00:16:42.760
Tell me.
说来听听。

395
00:16:42.900 --> 00:16:45.660
Because, you know, I loved the shooting draft of this script.
因为，你知道，我非常喜欢这个剧本的拍摄初稿。

396
00:16:46.200 --> 00:16:54.800
And Jenna and I have talked to you guys about how we would have a scene, and then sometimes in the moment, we'd play around with it, and it would change.
珍娜和我跟你们聊过，我们拍戏时会有剧本，但有时在现场，我们会即兴发挥，剧本就会变动。

397
00:16:55.040 --> 00:16:55.820
Right there in the moment.
就在那一瞬间。

398
00:16:56.640 --> 00:16:58.740
So, I think this is a great example.
所以，我觉得这是一个很好的例子。

399
00:16:58.740 --> 00:17:02.160
And I don't think our show could have been like this without Steve Carell.
而且我觉得如果没有史蒂夫·卡瑞尔，我们的剧就不会是现在这样。

