00:32:07.380 --> 00:32:12.220
a couple episodes ago he was so impressed with Michael that he was sending him out to
几集之前，他还对迈克尔印象深刻，甚至派他去

716
00:32:12.220 --> 00:32:13.300
speak to other branches?
其他分公司演讲？

717
00:32:13.760 --> 00:32:18.420
I never saw this as Charles babysitting Michael in particular.
我从来没觉得这是查尔斯在专门盯着迈克尔。

718
00:32:18.420 --> 00:32:21.920
I just saw this as this guy who's new to the company.
我只是觉得这人是公司新来的。

719
00:32:21.980 --> 00:32:22.860
He's an executive.
他是位高管。

720
00:32:22.980 --> 00:32:26.820
He's just going to go around to every branch and spend a day at the branch.
他只是打算去每个分公司转转，并在那里待上一天。

721
00:32:26.820 --> 00:32:28.260
He's going to get to know the people.
他要去了解一下员工。

722
00:32:28.420 --> 00:32:30.000
He's clearly going to bring them lunch.
显然他还会给他们带午餐。

723
00:32:30.440 --> 00:32:33.900
You know, this wasn't a babysitting thing where Michael was singled out.
你知道，这并不是那种针对迈克尔的监视行为。

724
00:32:34.060 --> 00:32:37.280
This is just what he's doing to kind of get to know people.
这只是他为了了解员工所做的工作而已。

725
00:32:37.640 --> 00:32:38.000
Exactly.
没错。

726
00:32:38.120 --> 00:32:39.060
This is standard practice.
这是标准流程。

727
