He's the VP of the Northeast region.
他是东北地区的副总裁。

728
00:32:41.120 --> 00:32:42.240
He's got to get to know his region.
他必须了解他负责的区域。

729
00:32:42.240 --> 00:32:46.560
Well, while Charles is setting up in the conference room, Michael's going to get David Wallace
好吧，当查尔斯在会议室安顿下来时，迈克尔打算给大卫·华莱士

