He's telling David, he says to David, he doesn't understand why they can't just leave the position
他告诉大卫，他对大卫说，他不明白为什么他们不能让这个职位

734
00:33:02.600 --> 00:33:03.020
vacant.
空缺着。

735
00:33:03.220 --> 00:33:04.680
And then here's my favorite line.
然后就是我最喜欢的那句台词。

736
00:33:04.900 --> 00:33:07.880
Truth be told, I think I thrive under a lack of accountability.
说实话，我觉得我在缺乏问责的情况下反而能做得更好。

737
00:33:07.880 --> 00:33:08.800
I know.
我知道。

738
00:33:12.140 --> 00:33:19.300
Michael asked David if he will be attending his anniversary party and if hiring Cirque du Soleil
迈克尔问大卫是否会参加他的周年庆派对，还问雇佣太阳马戏团

739
00:33:19.300 --> 00:33:23.500
performers as salaried employees would help with the year-end tax stuff.
的表演者作为正式员工是否能有助于年底的税务处理。

740
00:33:23.920 --> 00:33:24.920
No response.
没有回应。

741
00:33:25.320 --> 00:33:26.360
I counted.
我数过了。

742
00:33:26.620 --> 00:33:28.680
It's a seven-second silence.
沉默了七秒钟。

743
00:33:29.580 --> 00:33:30.780
It's so perfect.
太完美了。

744
00:33:30.880 --> 00:33:33.660
And then Dwight, who, by the way, they revealed was there the whole time.
然后是德怀特，顺便说一下，他们揭露了他一直都在旁边。

745
00:33:33.820 --> 00:33:35.260
It's classic Michael Dwight scene.
这是经典的迈克尔和德怀特的场景。

746
00:33:35.660 --> 00:33:37.480
Dwight's like, maybe he hung up?
德怀特说，也许他挂断了？

747
00:33:37.580 --> 00:33:39.420
And then he's like, no.
然后他说，没有。

748
00:33:40.980 --> 00:33:42.500
Michael comes out of this phone call.
迈克尔打完这通电话出来了。

749
00:33:42.680 --> 00:33:45.340
He's decided, all right, he's going to try to get to know Charles.
他决定了，好吧，他要试着去了解查尔斯。

750
00:33:46.000 --> 00:33:47.220
He's going to make an effort.
他要做出努力。

751
00:33:47.580 --> 00:33:50.780
He's going to ask him some personal questions right away.
他马上就要问他一些私人问题了。

752
00:33:50.920 --> 00:33:52.780
He's like, tell me something you've never told anyone before.
他就像是说，告诉我一些你从未告诉过别人的事。

753
00:33:53.240 --> 00:33:54.320
Charles is like, no.
查尔斯的回应是，不行。

754
00:33:55.820 --> 00:34:01.300
And before we get any further into this crazy meeting, because there is a scene that was deleted
在我们继续深入这场疯狂的会议之前，因为有一个被删减的片段

