00:34:01.300 --> 00:34:03.560
that I want to read to you, let's take a break.
我想读给你听，我们先休息一下。

756
00:34:03.860 --> 00:34:05.660
Yes, let's take a break and we'll be right back.
好的，我们休息一下，马上回来。

757
00:34:16.320 --> 00:34:17.500
All right, so we're back.
好了，我们回来了。

758
00:34:17.740 --> 00:34:18.620
We're in the conference room.
我们现在在会议室里。

759
00:34:18.620 --> 00:34:21.780
Michael is desperately trying to get to know Charles Minor.
迈克尔正拼命地想要了解查尔斯·迈纳。

760
00:34:22.040 --> 00:34:23.460
Charles Minor is having none of it.
查尔斯·迈纳根本不吃这一套。

761
00:34:23.620 --> 00:34:28.200
I know somewhere in an NBC vault, there's got to be tons of extra footage, because in
我知道在NBC的某个保险库里，肯定有大量的额外素材，因为在

762
00:34:28.200 --> 00:34:31.600
the script, there were all these bits, and you know Steve went off script.
剧本里，有所有这些小片段，而且你知道史蒂夫经常不按剧本演。

763
00:34:32.220 --> 00:34:34.440
So the scene would have started like this.
所以这场戏本来是这样开始的。

764
00:34:34.560 --> 00:34:35.200
Hi, Charles.
嗨，查尔斯。

765
00:34:35.400 --> 00:34:35.840
Hi, Michael.
嗨，迈克尔。

766
00:34:36.120 --> 00:34:40.040
And then Michael would go, Charles, Charles, Charles, Bo Barles, Banana, Fanna, Fanna,
然后迈克尔会说，查尔斯，查尔斯，查尔斯，波·巴尔斯，香蕉，法纳，法纳，

767
00:34:40.180 --> 00:34:40.660
Fofarles.
福法尔斯。

768
00:34:40.660 --> 00:34:44.400
And then he stops, and the script says, long beat.
然后他停下来，剧本上写着，长停顿。

769
