And there was a thing in the script where he was like, you guys just pitch me ideas because
剧本里还有一段是他对大家说，你们给我出出主意，

935
00:41:18.780 --> 00:41:21.240
maybe planning my party will make me feel better.
因为策划我的派对也许能让我感觉好点。

936
00:41:21.600 --> 00:41:23.260
I remember shooting this scene.
我记得拍这场戏的时候。

937
00:41:23.380 --> 00:41:25.320
We had a hard time getting through it.
我们很难忍住不笑。

938
00:41:25.480 --> 00:41:26.140
I bet.
我敢肯定。

939
00:41:26.300 --> 00:41:26.680
I bet.
我敢肯定。

940
00:41:27.080 --> 00:41:31.560
Well, while you guys start pitching party ideas, Charles is going to go over to Phyllis
嗯，当你们开始提派对点子的时候，查尔斯会走到菲利斯身边，

