我真希望那段能保留下来。

945
00:41:45.900 --> 00:41:47.820
Are you ready for some Phyllis sass?
准备好迎接菲利斯的毒舌了吗？

946
00:41:48.140 --> 00:41:49.380
Here's her talking head.
这是她的采访镜头。

947
00:41:50.200 --> 00:41:51.540
I built that house.
这房子是我建的。

948
00:41:51.720 --> 00:41:52.920
I can burn it down.
我也能把它烧了。

949
00:41:53.640 --> 00:42:04.670
Oh, I love this side of Phyllis, especially when it's not directed at Angela.
噢，我喜欢菲利斯这一面，尤其是当她不是针对安吉拉的时候。

950
00:42:06.150 --> 00:42:11.750
Well, in that moment when Charles is talking to Phyllis, at 14 minutes, 48 seconds, you
嗯，在查尔斯和菲利斯谈话的那一刻，在14分48秒时，你

951
00:42:11.750 --> 00:42:17.030
get a real good shot of this silver insulated coffee mug that he's been carrying around all
拍一张他整天随身带着的那个银色保温咖啡杯的特写

952
00:42:17.030 --> 00:42:17.370
day.
。

953
00:42:17.830 --> 00:42:19.210
Do you know what it said on it?
你知道上面写着什么吗？

954
00:42:19.510 --> 00:42:19.950
