Sadekoy Steel.
Sadekoy Steel。

956
00:42:21.830 --> 00:42:23.190
Oh, nice detail.
哦，不错的细节。

957
00:42:23.630 --> 00:42:24.870
Way to go, Phil Shea.
干得好，菲尔·谢伊。

958
00:42:24.970 --> 00:42:25.190
Yeah.
是啊。

959
00:42:25.310 --> 00:42:31.830
Because when Charles enters the conference room, he is holding that Sadekoy Steel coffee mug
因为当查尔斯走进会议室时，他拿着那个Sadekoy Steel咖啡杯

960
00:42:31.830 --> 00:42:33.570
eye level to Michael Scott.
举到迈克尔·斯科特视线平齐的高度。

961
00:42:33.910 --> 00:42:34.890
And I don't know.
我不知道。

962
00:42:35.030 --> 00:42:39.610
I just felt like it was subliminally pissing Michael off.
我只是觉得这在潜意识里让迈克尔很火大。

963
00:42:39.970 --> 00:42:40.470
Just poking the bear.
就是在挑衅他。

964
00:42:40.650 --> 00:42:40.830
Yeah.
是啊。

965
00:42:40.950 --> 00:42:42.510
Just rubbing it in his face.
就是在往他脸上抹黑。

966
